UID:33663@moodle.alaqsa.edu.ps
SUMMARY:Assignment 2: Case Study مستحق
DESCRIPTION:You manage a database system where users report slow query perf
	ormance when retrieving data. Based on the knowledge from Chapter 11\, iden
	tify at least FIVE COMMON QUERY PROCESSING BOTTLENECKS (e.g.\, CPU\, RAM\, 
	disk I/O\, network latency\, inefficient SQL code). For each bottleneck:\n\
	n	* Describe how it affects query performance.\n	* Propose TWO SOLUTIONS or
	 strategies to mitigate the impact of each bottleneck.\n\n
	
